  translation {
    text: "Affected direction: Eastbound\r\n\nAffected eastbound trips:\r\n12:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n12:30 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n1:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n1:30 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n2:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n2:30 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n3:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n3:30 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n4:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n4:30 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n5:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n5:30 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n6:00 pm from Union Station Track 1\r\n6:30 pm from Union Station Track 1"
